# Digests (receipts, accept_product, calibration corpus) are taken over file bytes. A Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf turns LF into CRLF, so the same file digests differently on two machines.
# Text is LF in the working tree on every platform; binary files are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
